            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A polyp detection system configured for application to seed images to identify seed images which include polyps, wherein the polyp detection system is further configured for application to each seed image of the seed images based on one or more images associated with the seed image and probabilities associated with the seed image and with one or more associated images.</p>
